id: pm-context-ubo1
title: Reduce context with declared answer-preservation proofs
description: "Accept an explicit finite decision table and source-fragment dependencies. Exhaustively prove which declared input values cannot affect the answer, omit only invariant fragments, and retain branch irrelevance certificates. Coverage packing selects evidence; shared factoring deduplicates it; pm-jev proposes answers but cannot supply this proof."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[5]: answer-preservation,context,"gh:unbraind/pm-context#213",proof,reduction
created_at: "2026-11-05T06:03:31.478Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-05T10:14:43.607Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Every declared routing input combination produces the same full and reduced answer with at least 50 percent fewer measured UTF-8 bytes including proofs; unsupported predicates retain evidence and report unknown; typed SDK and CLI with JSON/TOON and actionable refusals; non-git real public tracker validation; seeded 500-sequence producer/validator and SDK-state replay tests; packed npm/Bun installation acceptance; unchanged CI release gates pass.
comments[18]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-05T06:04:14.364Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check against main: pm CLI 2026.11.4 public context-packing declarations expose candidate selection and projections, without finite-domain answer-preservation certificates. Existing evidence-packing.ts covers criteria, shared-evidence.ts factors exact revision/value pairs, and pm-jev counterfactual.ts produces model-dependent explanations. None proves declared deterministic routing invariance. Plan: bounded exhaustive first-match equality table, revision-bound source reads through createSharedEvidenceReader, cofactor certificates for each omitted variable branch, conservative unknown predicates, common JSON/TOON producer/validator, read-only non-git and packed-launcher acceptance. This feature introduces no tracker imports, writes, retry journal, outbox, claims or mutable shared state; all tracker state remains SDK-owned."
  "2026-11-05T06:16:12.529Z",codex-agent,"Implemented bounded exhaustive eq/neq first-match routing, exact cofactor comparisons and branch certificates, revision-bound fragments, per-source unknowns and shared producer-derived JSON/TOON validation. Public origin/main snapshot 363e8bc: 102 items; four distinct descriptions totaling 5071 UTF-8 bytes. Full/reduced JSON 7600/2526 bytes (66.7632 percent saved); TOON 7625/2547 (66.5967 percent). All four combinations agree; four omitted fragments reference two proved background branches; read-only snapshot fingerprint unchanged. Disposable-copy behavioral reverts: disabling omission and bypassing stale-revision comparison each fail the routing regression after rebuild. Focused new-module coverage initially measured 100 percent across all four c8 dimensions; final seeded-model and packed runs are pending."
  "2026-11-05T06:25:21.044Z",codex-agent,"Packed acquisition passed 6 modes and 42 assertions: npm/Bun project-local, npm/Bun global, npx and bunx, all with host 2026.11.4. Captured artifact SHA-256 e0a519d38f618d72777186671f975321f93e749cbbd68eb906fb23564ae12564 stayed unchanged; 57 packed files, 655809 unpacked bytes. Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate and production audit pass (zero production vulnerabilities). Targeted answer-reduction.ts c8 coverage is 210/210 statements, 210/210 branches and 21/21 functions (100 percent lines). Model fixture now verifies every initially populated native field before SDK status transitions, then compares current and absent fields against SDK read-back rather than assuming terminal fields persist. Test result tracking is disabled, so linked-run receipts are documented here without changing that policy."
  "2026-11-05T06:27:01.160Z",codex-agent,"Final local linked run passed 15/15 tests, zero skipped/canceled/failed, via pm test pm-context-ubo1 --run --progress --timeout 900 (receipt test-local-mw35wyg4-jsos7q). The 500 seeded sequences exercised 52 populated native fields, 4000 transport round trips and 8000 independent routing answers; every current/older request compared with SDK read-back, and all four peer-read boundaries passed. The additional registration regression passed 1/1. Scope: finite declared domains and dependencies only; optimistic revision observations are not locks. Final full npm/Bun release evidence will be attached to the ready-for-review PR after CI; tracker writes finish before that verification. Item remains in progress for orchestrator verification; no merge, release or closure is authorized."
  "2026-11-05T08:23:28.888Z",codex-agent,"Review round: synced beeb567; origin/main is already an ancestor. Retrieved all four unresolved threads with complete comments; latest CodeRabbit review contains two test-strengthening nits and no Outside diff range section. Will harden shapes and serialized budgets, guard measurement root, prove each regression by behavioral reverts in disposable copies, then run unchanged npm and Bun release gates."
  "2026-11-05T08:27:38.994Z",codex-agent,"Verified all four review defects. Added standard-prototype, enumerable-data and proxy guards shared by request/source/output validation; removed output representation coercion. Source acceptance now budgets serialized JSON cumulatively with packet overhead and only commits budgets on success. Measurement rejects non-directory or linked roots before scratch copy or chmod. Added nested shape matrices, individual/cumulative escape-overflow cases, permission-preservation regression, mixed-dependency retention and installation evidence assertions. Plain JSON, frozen declarations and legacy optional undefined SDK fields remain supported."
  "2026-11-05T08:29:32.580Z",codex-agent,"Nine isolated behavioral mutations fail as required: keys enumerability, array prototype, cumulative serialized budget, object proxy, array proxy, array element enumerability, output representation coercion, mixed dependency omission, and export-root guard. Rebuilt dist for each mutation. Disposable restore run passed all new regressions; its existing CLI acceptance initially lacked the manifest fixture, so the complete sandbox restore run will be repeated with that fixture included. The package worktree was never mutated for revert tests."
  "2026-11-05T08:33:43.650Z",codex-agent,"Linked pm tests passed: 15/15 existing feature/model/renderer tests and 4/4 review regressions, zero failures/skips. Native model: 500 sequences, 52 native fields, 4000 transport round trips, 8000 independently checked answers. Project policy disables automatic linked-result tracking, so results are recorded here without changing policy. Nine behavioral mutations all failed with the intended assertions; sandbox-only missing manifest has been corrected for the final fixed restoration check."
  "2026-11-05T08:39:06.799Z",codex-agent,"Self-review found one further packet-boundary case: 4096 routing rows with eight wide scalar inputs can exceed the packet limit before sources. Added INVALID_REQUEST refusal before any read, plus a nearby allowed 4096-row case. Focused review tests pass 5/5 against source and dist. Restarting the preliminary npm gate after this change; the stopped pre-change run is not final gate evidence. No thresholds changed."
  "2026-11-05T08:39:31.258Z",codex-agent,"Final behavioral proof total: 10/10 mutations failed the intended regression after rebuild (four review fixes plus proxy, array enumerable, output coercion, mixed dependencies and routing overhead cases). Fixed disposable-copy source and rebuilt dist then passed all 11/11 focused tests, including no-git CLI acceptance; zero failures/skips. Revert tests never changed the package worktree. Linked review command rerun covers all five current review regressions."
  "2026-11-05T08:58:24.288Z",codex-agent,"Final npm run release:check passed under an isolated HOME and disabled global/system Git config on Node 24.19.0: 459/459 tests, zero failures/skips; all 18 required sources have 100 percent V8 lines/branches/functions. c8 whole-package statements/functions/lines 100 percent, branches 99.96 percent; answer-reduction.ts 100 percent in all four dimensions. Unchanged thresholds, zero production audit findings, pack dry-run and publish/changelog attestation checks pass. Bun gate running separately. Tracker health passes without drift; its legacy provenance advisory is retained, not repaired."
  "2026-11-05T08:59:26.065Z",codex-agent,"Thread dispositions: PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs6z9Nv- -> keys requires enumerable data descriptors; PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs6z9NwO -> dense requires Array.prototype; PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs6z9NwV -> serialized value_json cumulative budget checked before accepting sources; PRRT_kwDOSzDuFs6z9NwZ -> real directory root required before copy or chmod. Each behavioral revert rebuilt with node_modules/.bin/tsc in a disposable copy, then node --test --test-concurrency=2 --test-name-pattern=<request shape matrix|escaped source|measurement refuses> test/answer-reduction-review.test.ts failed with the intended missing refusal, INVALID_OUTPUT, or changed-original-mode assertion. All four findings are valid. No review replies or thread resolutions were performed."
  "2026-11-05T09:25:14.262Z",codex-agent,"Both pre-wire-boundary release gates passed 459/459 at unchanged thresholds, but self-review then confirmed escaped routing can fit 7651328 character units while its routing JSON alone is 40079361 bytes, above the existing 33554432-byte saved-file cap. Added a shared producer/reader byte ceiling, baseline refusal before reads, newline reservation, and per-source escaped UTF-8 budget charged only on acceptance. New real-file regression failed before the fix (missing expected INVALID_REQUEST) and includes a nearby accepted escaped table plus healthy-peer preservation. Final gates will be repeated after the byte fix; credentials and agent provenance context are excluded from those CI-like child environments."
  "2026-11-05T09:28:07.841Z",codex-agent,"Final source is now covered by 12/12 isolated behavioral mutations, each rebuilding dist and failing its intended assertion, including independent removal of the early routing-byte guard and the per-source wire-byte guard. Restored source and rebuilt dist pass all 12/12 focused tests, including accepted large escaped packets read by the real saved-file reader. The linked review command was rerun for all six current regressions. No tracked history was rewritten."
  "2026-11-05T09:53:41.739Z",codex-agent,"Final byte-hardened source passed npm run release:check: 460/460 tests, zero failures/skips, unchanged thresholds, isolated Git identity and credential/agent-context-free child environment. V8 required-source lines/branches/functions all 100 percent across 18 files; c8 whole-package statements/functions/lines 100 percent and branches 99.96 percent. All production audit, package, and release attestation checks pass. Final Bun gate is now running against this same implementation."
  "2026-11-05T10:12:06.560Z",codex-agent,"Final unchanged-threshold release gates both pass on the byte-hardened source: npm 460/460 and Bun 460/460, zero failures, cancellations or skips. V8 all 18 required files at 100 percent lines/branches/functions; c8 new module 230/230 statements and lines, 229/229 branches, 21/21 functions, all 100 percent. Whole-package c8 100 percent statements/functions/lines and 99.96 percent branches. Both production audits, package dry-runs and release attestation checks pass. Capturing the immutable artifact for six-launcher acceptance next."
  "2026-11-05T10:14:37.712Z",codex-agent,"Final immutable package acceptance passed 60/60 semantic assertions across npm/Bun project-local and isolated global installs, npx and bunx, including proved state, retained Routing title, background omission, JSON/TOON, saved checks and artifact stability. One captured artifact: SHA-256 7878f0024b8daba70ac6e56660f791114fce5b2870e0fd61623b3e556f179035, 57 files, 659006 unpacked bytes. Public origin/main export measurement passed on 102 items: 5071 source-description bytes, 4 combinations, 8 independent answer checks, 4 omissions, JSON 7600 -> 2526 bytes (66.76 percent), TOON 7625 -> 2547 (66.60 percent), read-only non-git copy unchanged. Binary artifacts remain untracked."
  "2026-11-05T10:14:42.402Z",codex-agent,"All four unresolved review findings are fixed and each has a failing behavioral revert. Self-review covers standard prototypes, enumerable data descriptors, proxies, accessors, sparse arrays, representation coercion and both character/wire-byte limits. Final npm and Bun release gates each pass 460/460 at unchanged thresholds; 12/12 mutations fail and restored focused tests pass 12/12. Latest complete review census still has only the original four threads and no Outside diff range section. No replies or resolutions were made. Item remains in progress for orchestrator verification; verify the pushed head via https://github.com/unbraind/pm-context/pull/213/checks. Open advisory: legacy provenance warning retained under append-only history policy; no pm CLI/SDK defect was filed."
